### Frontend build output (generated by the `frontend` Maven profile) ###
# Produced by `npm run build:spring` in frontend/: the hashed bundle, the SPA
# shell, its public assets and the legacy-path entry pages. Not versioned so
# review candidates stay source-only; build with
# `mvn -Pfrontend package` (needs Node + npm on PATH).
#
# Every entry the build writes belongs to this list, with no exceptions: the
# bundle hash depends on the locked dependency tree, so a versioned copy is
# stale from the commit that adds it and its page then points at assets that
# are not in the repository. `pedidos/` and `platform/` were versioned by
# omission (they compiled and served fine when the bundle happened to match)
# until frontend/tests/build-artifacts.test.ts pinned the rule: the only
# versioned file under static/ is the checked-in favicon.ico.
api/src/main/resources/static/index.html
api/src/main/resources/static/assets/
api/src/main/resources/static/ding.mp3
api/src/main/resources/static/ready.mp3
api/src/main/resources/static/favicon.svg
api/src/main/resources/static/menu/index.html
api/src/main/resources/static/login/login.html
api/src/main/resources/static/dashboard/index.html
api/src/main/resources/static/kds/index.html
api/src/main/resources/static/admin/admin.html
api/src/main/resources/static/pedidos/index.html
api/src/main/resources/static/platform/index.html
# Copia generada por el build desde frontend/public/dev-media/
api/src/main/resources/static/dev-media/
uploads/

# Dependencias instaladas fuera de frontend/ (npm install accidental en la raíz)
node_modules/
frontend/test-results/
